[dann] VERDICT: BOUNDARY
BOUNDARY -- OBJREL did not recover 6-seed-blind (0/6 overall, 0/3 blind; need >=5/6 AND all blind) -- the Dale-legal inhibitory population does NOT carry the negative rows well enough on this substrate (objrel-slot0 mean 0.00); CANONICAL regressed (<0.90 on some seed; mean 0.83) -- the read see-saws like RANK-2 (lifting objrel via inhibition regressed canonical); BPTT is INERT (0-epoch objrel-slot0 0.17 already ~= trained 0.00; training did no real work -- the retracted inertness, NOT a real result); the inhibitory population is NOT load-bearing (silencing it 0.50 does not drop objrel >=0.15 below the trained read 0.00 -- the recovery, if any, is not flowing through the Dale-legal inhibition); the scrambled-label control did NOT collapse (the read is a position/heterogeneity artifact). THE PRECISE FRONTIER (load-bearing, from the ANALYTIC Dale reference reported per seed): the Dale-LEGAL signed spiking read EXISTS in weight space -- the ridge split into an EXCITATORY E path (positive rows) + a genuinely-INHIBITORY interneuron population (negative rows) reads canonical 1.00 AND objrel-slot0 1.00 GENUINELY ON SPIKES + Dale-legal at the graded op-point (silencing that inhibition collapses objrel to 0.00 -- the negative rows DO flow through Dale-legal inhibition, proving the substrate + Dale constraint are NOT the wall). The wall is BPTT REACHABILITY: from a Dale-legal random init the read defaults to the MAJORITY canonical-AGENT solution on the shared slot0 (a 7:1 THEME:AGENT imbalance) and surrogate-gradient descent walks AWAY from the minority-THEME signed solution (trained objrel-slot0 0.00 vs a random-init that reads canonical but never THEME) -- warm-starting from the ridge would BE the retracted inert-BPTT confound, so it is NOT done. The reservoir FEATURE robustly encodes objrel (a HOST linear argmax generalizes it held-out ~100% with a ~66% margin -- NOT the Mikulasch-Priesemann representation wall). These numbers characterize EXACTLY how far a Dale-legal DANN spiking read-out carries it, GENUINELY ON SPIKES and Dale-LEGAL (neither retracted confound is repeated -- spike-count read, like-for-like vs the fixed spiking WTA, every weight sign-constrained). An HONEST characterization; NO anti-cheat was weakened to force a GO.
